                "text": "NEW: I\u2019m a part of a bipartisan group of House Members announcing a new health care framework to extend the Affordable Care Act's enhanced premium tax credits.\n\nWe must work together to get a proposal to the House floor that will cut insurance costs and ensure families can make ends meet.",
