                "text": "Republicans\u2019 devastating cuts to Medicaid are hurting NH health care providers and organizations\u2019 ability to serve Granite Staters, including Opportunity Networks which provides individuals with disabilities with essential support to gain employment and fully participate in their communities. \n\nI heard from their staff and families today.",
